134
00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:16.400
And the reasons touch on some of the same themes that you mentioned in your letters about wanting to find work-life balance and also wanting to try something new.

135
00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:23.320
And Angela and I have shared a little bit about how podcasting came into our lives, and we do write about it in our book, The Office VFFs.

136
00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:30.100
