00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:18.140
We thank you so much for being on this journey with us.

341
00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:19.060
A hundred percent.

342
00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:21.380
There is no Office Ladies without this community.

343
00:13:21.680 --> 00:13:24.760
And you guys are the 500 million downloads.

344
00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:25.820
It's you.

345
00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:26.980
You're the reason we're here.

346
00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:30.220
