00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:33.080
And we get to work with each other's best friends again.

348
00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:35.800
And we just love you guys from the bottom of our hearts.

349
00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:42.000
And I guess also I would say to Rachel and Paula, in answer to your questions, starting

350
00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:46.380
