353
00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:57.840
It can be a very humbling thing to start something new.

354
00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:02.460
And that's another reason why we wanted to play this for you, so that you can see where

355
00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:03.060
we started.

356
00:14:03.220 --> 00:14:04.560
Because it is not perfect.

357
00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:05.520
Oh, no, not at all.

358
00:14:05.600 --> 00:14:06.700
It is far from perfect.

359
00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:08.640
But it was the start of something.

